{"server":"cn","storyId":"main_7_level_main_07-08_beg","groupId":"main_7","stageId":"main_07-08","title":"暗淡者之火","storyCode":"7-10","avgTag":"行动前","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_07-08_beg.txt","sourceHash":"a09af5559d1aaecfd52486d671da3d1ddb34a6db3b1a96c1532b33e059e8bdac","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"Guard的出现令人意外，而凯尔希对他的突然审判更是出人意料。\n不过被感染市民的态度也终于有所松动。","blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_warehouse"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"Guard，解释你的作为。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗德岛近卫干员？","speakerId":"avg_npc_059","isRemote":false,"text":"我看上去完全是个整合运动了......是吗。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乌萨斯感染者","speakerId":"avg_npc_057","isRemote":false,"text":"所以你们认识。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乌萨斯感染者","speakerId":"avg_npc_057","isRemote":false,"text":"好，那这个卡特斯感染者说的一切都是谎话。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乌萨斯感染者","speakerId":"avg_npc_057","isRemote":false,"text":"你和整合运动原本就是一边的！对不对！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗德岛近卫干员？","speakerId":"avg_npc_059","isRemote":false,"text":"......塔季......你找到食物了吗？避难处的大家也撑不了太长时间了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乌萨斯感染者","speakerId":"avg_npc_057","isRemote":false,"text":"你还要逼我多久！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗德岛近卫干员？","speakerId":"avg_npc_059","isRemote":false,"text":"先让你到安全的地方再说。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"不要靠近她，Guard！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗德岛近卫干员？","speakerId":"avg_npc_059","isRemote":false,"text":"我不会。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗德岛近卫干员？","speakerId":"avg_npc_059","isRemote":false,"text":"......我知道事情很难解释。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗德岛近卫干员？","speakerId":"avg_npc_059","isRemote":false,"text":"但我们最好都小心些。这个区域里所有的乌萨斯被动感染者......都过得非常糟。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗德岛近卫干员？","speakerId":"avg_npc_059","isRemote":false,"text":"他们中的大多数已经处在精神崩溃的边缘......就只差有人推那么一下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乌萨斯感染者","speakerId":"avg_npc_057","isRemote":false,"text":"你把这叫做“糟”？你们这些杀人狂！你们这些肮脏的虐待狂！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乌萨斯感染者","speakerId":"avg_npc_057","isRemote":false,"text":"我也被......我也被你们弄成这样！变成这样！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗德岛近卫干员？","speakerId":"avg_npc_059","isRemote":false,"text":"但是，你再不走，就会被魔族人找到，然后丢给其他整合运动。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗德岛近卫干员？","speakerId":"avg_npc_059","isRemote":false,"text":"爱国者的部队已经被完全调出这个区域了。你被抓住，我就彻底没办法救你了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乌萨斯感染者","speakerId":"avg_npc_057","isRemote":false,"text":"那就让我死好了！就让我死在这片你们这些怪物横行的地上！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乌萨斯感染者","speakerId":"avg_npc_057","isRemote":false,"text":"什么游击队，什么感染者的盾......他们有区别吗？和其他整合运动有区别吗？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗德岛近卫干员？","speakerId":"avg_npc_059","isRemote":false,"text":"有。没有他们，我们都已经死了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乌萨斯感染者","speakerId":"avg_npc_057","isRemote":false,"text":"那你解释给我听，解释！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乌萨斯感染者","speakerId":"avg_npc_057","isRemote":false,"text":"如果他们真的像你这几天说的那样只做对的事，为什么他们还呆在这整合运动？为什么他们会让这里变成这样？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乌萨斯感染者","speakerId":"avg_npc_057","isRemote":false,"text":"为什么不反抗？为什么不出走？！为什么知道我们被杀，被亵渎，被报复却还是让这些事情发生？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乌萨斯感染者","speakerId":"avg_npc_057","isRemote":false,"text":"你说的游击队为什么没和这些巡逻的魔族怪物厮杀？！为什么？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乌萨斯感染者","speakerId":"avg_npc_057","isRemote":false,"text":"我看着它们亲手，亲手......用手就扯掉了......我......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗德岛近卫干员？","speakerId":"avg_npc_059","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗德岛近卫干员？","speakerId":"avg_npc_059","isRemote":false,"text":"爱国者看不见的地方太多了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗德岛近卫干员？","speakerId":"avg_npc_059","isRemote":false,"text":"当需要爱国者指挥他的队伍才能捍卫其他人生存权利的时候，我就知道这里已经出了问题。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗德岛近卫干员？","speakerId":"avg_npc_059","isRemote":false,"text":"即使如此......只要还有游击队会从这里走过，就不会有险恶的整合运动成员踏足这片区域。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗德岛近卫干员？","speakerId":"avg_npc_059","isRemote":false,"text":"这已经区别了暴徒和游击队战士。爱国者手下的，即使是萨卡兹，也比许多普通整合运动感染者更守规矩。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乌萨斯感染者","speakerId":"avg_npc_057","isRemote":false,"text":"那他们为什么不在这里？！为什么！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乌萨斯感染者","speakerId":"avg_npc_057","isRemote":false,"text":"他们不在以后，剩下的那些感染者只是更残暴更恶劣地对待我们！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乌萨斯感染者","speakerId":"avg_npc_057","isRemote":false,"text":"这不是他们的错吗？这不是游击队的错吗！没有游击队，他们就不会这么对我们了，对不对？！他们在报复游击队！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗德岛近卫干员？","speakerId":"avg_npc_059","isRemote":false,"text":"你说得不对。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗德岛近卫干员？","speakerId":"avg_npc_059","isRemote":false,"text":"游击队做的没错。就像你自己也那么觉得......其他人有可能是在报复游击队。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗德岛近卫干员？","speakerId":"avg_npc_059","isRemote":false,"text":"那整合运动报复游击队的原因，就只是因为游击队战士在捍卫你们的活下去的机会。只会如此。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗德岛近卫干员？","speakerId":"avg_npc_059","isRemote":false,"text":"不。游击队......甚至在捍卫你们的尊严。我亲眼看到。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗德岛近卫干员？","speakerId":"avg_npc_059","isRemote":false,"text":"我看到那个战士命令其他整合运动喊你们名字，而不是数字。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗德岛近卫干员？","speakerId":"avg_npc_059","isRemote":false,"text":"是不是？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乌萨斯感染者","speakerId":"avg_npc_057","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗德岛近卫干员？","speakerId":"avg_npc_059","isRemote":false,"text":"以及，游击队留下我们，就是为了在他们不在的时候帮助你们。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗德岛近卫干员？","speakerId":"avg_npc_059","isRemote":false,"text":"......整个切尔诺伯格已经被切割成了许多块。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗德岛近卫干员？","speakerId":"avg_npc_059","isRemote":false,"text":"也许有些地方还驻扎着游击队员，但他们不在的地方......如果没人维持纪律，那么就只能靠我们......领你们活下去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗德岛近卫干员？","speakerId":"avg_npc_059","isRemote":false,"text":"哪怕我们可能根本活不下去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗德岛近卫干员？","speakerId":"avg_npc_059","isRemote":false,"text":"阿米娅，我刚才说的，你相信吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乌萨斯感染者","speakerId":"avg_npc_057","isRemote":false,"text":"不！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乌萨斯感染者","speakerId":"avg_npc_057","isRemote":false,"text":"卡特斯女孩，你看......你看！他是整合运动！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乌萨斯感染者","speakerId":"avg_npc_057","isRemote":false,"text":"你们难道要信整合运动吗？还有，我，我变成感染者就该信整合运动的胡说八道了吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乌萨斯感染者","speakerId":"avg_npc_057","isRemote":false,"text":"你看看，刚才你说那些要杀我们的，不也是整合运动？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乌萨斯感染者","speakerId":"avg_npc_057","isRemote":false,"text":"我现在变成感染者，整合运动难道就待我更好了吗？所以我怎么知道你们谁是谁，你们谁要杀我！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乌萨斯感染者","speakerId":"avg_npc_057","isRemote":false,"text":"你们，整合运动，全都该......全都该......！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"（阿米娅。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"（医生？）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"（接下来别冲动。）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":"avg_npc_042","isRemote":false,"text":"凯尔希？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":"avg_npc_042","isRemote":false,"text":"凯尔希，我们应该继续向上走。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗德岛近卫干员？","speakerId":"avg_npc_059","isRemote":false,"text":"......你......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗德岛近卫干员？","speakerId":"avg_npc_059","isRemote":false,"text":"怎么会是她......！怎么是她！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗德岛近卫干员？","speakerId":"avg_npc_059","isRemote":false,"text":"你们......要彻底消灭整合运动吗？！罗德岛也......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":"avg_npc_042","isRemote":false,"text":"？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗德岛近卫干员？","speakerId":"avg_npc_059","isRemote":false,"text":"......不管怎样！这附近的萨卡兹佣兵巡逻队，会在这个时间段经过这个仓库！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗德岛近卫干员？","speakerId":"avg_npc_059","isRemote":false,"text":"如果不处理他们，或者不躲好的话，很容易就会被他们发现，掳走......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗德岛近卫干员？","speakerId":"avg_npc_059","isRemote":false,"text":"加上普通整合运动的巡逻队，我们只有一点点时间能出来寻找物资！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗德岛近卫干员？","speakerId":"avg_npc_059","isRemote":false,"text":"就因为这样，许多人食不果腹，还缺乏必要药品，死亡在切尔诺伯格的居民中蔓延。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗德岛近卫干员？","speakerId":"avg_npc_059","isRemote":false,"text":"阿米娅，凯尔希医生！还有......Dr.{@nickname}，如果可以的话，至少相信我这些话，至少我们先躲起来！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"Guard......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"乌萨斯的感染者。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乌萨斯感染者","speakerId":"avg_npc_057","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乌萨斯感染者","speakerId":"avg_npc_057","isRemote":false,"text":"你在叫我？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"乌萨斯的感染者，我诚恳地向你咨询数个问题。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乌萨斯感染者","speakerId":"avg_npc_057","isRemote":false,"text":"你，你的口音......你是从帝国首都来的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乌萨斯感染者","speakerId":"avg_npc_057","isRemote":false,"text":"但你的用词，好老旧......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"你受过高等教育。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乌萨斯感染者","speakerId":"avg_npc_057","isRemote":false,"text":"......我以前是大学的抄写员。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乌萨斯感染者","speakerId":"avg_npc_057","isRemote":false,"text":"现在，拜你们感染者所赐，一切都毁了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"那么，你信任你身后那位，曾经身为我们雇员的现整合运动感染者吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乌萨斯感染者","speakerId":"avg_npc_057","isRemote":false,"text":"啊？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乌萨斯感染者","speakerId":"avg_npc_057","isRemote":false,"text":"他......是你们的雇员？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"罗德岛在战斗状态中，有为无辜感染者处理生存问题的职能。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"你是否无辜，我们尚无法判断......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"但是。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mon3tr","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"————"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乌萨斯感染者","speakerId":"avg_npc_057","isRemote":false,"text":"啊！！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"凯尔希医生！"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"你做什么！","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乌萨斯感染者","speakerId":"avg_npc_057","isRemote":false,"text":"你，你那个，什么，是，唔......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗德岛近卫干员？","speakerId":"avg_npc_059","isRemote":false,"text":"......没想到我自己有被Mon3tr抓住的这天。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"抵在你脖子上的这部分锋刃，切入角只有8度，深入6mm就足够切开你的大动脉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"小姐。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乌萨斯感染者","speakerId":"avg_npc_057","isRemote":false,"text":"唔，呃......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"他有像自己所说的那样坚定地保护你们的生存权吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乌萨斯感染者","speakerId":"avg_npc_057","isRemote":false,"text":"你问的是什么......你这么问，要干什么！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"他和他所属的整合运动，不分是哪一部分，有威胁到你的生命，甚至做出伤害你的举动吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"如实回答，我会按照你的回答来处理他。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乌萨斯感染者","speakerId":"avg_npc_057","isRemote":false,"text":"你用他的命威胁我？！我和他......和他......根本就没有关系！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"落实到他个人，他有跟随整合运动犯下侵害他人的罪行吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗德岛近卫干员？","speakerId":"avg_npc_059","isRemote":false,"text":"医生......不要侮辱我！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"我能采信的只有目击者与受害者。既然你声称保证了她的生存权，那么能判断你是否犯下罪行的唯一证据，就是这位小姐的证词。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"你所说的一切都只是一面之词。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗德岛近卫干员？","speakerId":"avg_npc_059","isRemote":false,"text":"可她说的难道不也——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"她的身份与你不同。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"你有力量。你具备施加暴力的能力，无论这种暴力被你用来做什么。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":"avg_npc_042","isRemote":false,"text":"我感受到了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":"avg_npc_042","isRemote":false,"text":"阿米娅，是萨卡兹人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":"avg_npc_042","isRemote":false,"text":"目标个体已经十分靠近了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乌萨斯感染者","speakerId":"avg_npc_057","isRemote":false,"text":"就不能......可他......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"他是否曾经为你们抵挡其他整合运动？他是否切实地使你们免遭充满攻击性的整合运动的侵害？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗德岛近卫干员？","speakerId":"avg_npc_059","isRemote":false,"text":"医生......！巡逻队已经到了！这个不是......不是游击队的巡逻队！不能，不能让他们......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乌萨斯感染者","speakerId":"avg_npc_057","isRemote":false,"text":"你们不讲道理！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"我认为我们的行为完全符合乌萨斯伦理道德的要求，是你对他进行了指控。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乌萨斯感染者","speakerId":"avg_npc_057","isRemote":false,"text":"他......他确实每次都这时候出去......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗德岛近卫干员？","speakerId":"avg_npc_059","isRemote":false,"text":"医生！让我去......拦那些萨卡兹人！如果不这样......我至少可以骗他们！让他们不走这里！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"先回答。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"说出来。否则没人知道真相。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":"avg_npc_042","isRemote":false,"text":"直线距离二十四米。很近了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乌萨斯感染者","speakerId":"avg_npc_057","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":"avg_npc_042","isRemote":false,"text":"二十二米。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"Mon3tr。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗德岛近卫干员？","speakerId":"avg_npc_059","isRemote":false,"text":"医生！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乌萨斯感染者","speakerId":"avg_npc_057","isRemote":false,"text":"没有！从来没有！起码他从来没做过坏事！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乌萨斯感染者","speakerId":"avg_npc_057","isRemote":false,"text":"反正，反正我没有见过！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"阿米娅。博士。"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"啊？","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"......","value":"2","blocks":[]},{"label":"演得可真像。","value":"3","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"有劳。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"哎呀......医生！我就知道......！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"博士，我们走！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"目标，整合运动的萨卡兹巡逻队！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":"avg_npc_042","isRemote":false,"text":"我也来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":"avg_npc_042","isRemote":false,"text":"Guard，对吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":"avg_npc_042","isRemote":false,"text":"你误会我了。但我会保护你。我会替你报复它们。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":"avg_npc_042","isRemote":false,"text":"它们对你们，对我的家人，对普通人做的，我全都要报复一遍，全都要。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_002_amiya","aliases":["阿米娅"]},{"speakerId":"char_003_kalts","aliases":["凯尔希"]}]}
